      "description": "The text 'first gay pride parade! can't wait!' refers to a real-world cultural and social event celebrating LGBTQ+ identity and visibility. Understanding the peaceful, celebratory, and inclusive nature of these parades is essential to recognizing the meme's distortion of their purpose and the harmful message it conveys.",
