      "label": "The man is mapped as the entity making history in the context of the gay pride parade.",
      "description": "The text 'making history' is juxtaposed with the visual of the man in a tough-guy persona. The meme implies that the man (or his persona) is the one 'making history' by association with the gay pride parade, which is a harmful and misleading projection. The visual of the aggressive, violent persona is mapped onto the concept of 'making history' to suggest that LGBTQ+ visibility is inherently dangerous or disruptive, which is a false and harmful interpretation.",
